---
import GuideLayout from '../../components/GuideLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../site';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const faq = [
  {
    q: 'When should a gym send a fee reminder?',
    a: 'A common rhythm is a friendly note a few days before the membership ends, one on the due date, and one gentle follow-up a few days after. More than that starts to feel like chasing.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Can I send gym fee reminders on WhatsApp?',
    a: 'Yes, as long as the member agreed to get messages from the gym. Send one message to one member, not a group: dues are private. For many members at once, the WhatsApp Business app or the WhatsApp Business API is the usual route.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Should the reminder say the amount?',
    a: 'Yes. The amount, the date and how to pay in one message saves a back-and-forth. Do not post amounts in a group chat where other members can see them.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How does SpotAI handle fee reminders?',
    a: 'The owner console lists every overdue member with the amount and days late, and the reminder button only works for members who allowed reminders. Members see what they owe and pay with UPI in the app. In the pilot, reminders and UPI run in demo mode.',
  },
];
---

<GuideLayout
  slug="gym-fee-reminder-message"
  title="Gym fee reminder message: WhatsApp templates in English and Hindi · SpotAI"
  description="Copy-paste gym fee reminder messages for WhatsApp and SMS: before the due date, on the day, and after, in English and Hindi. Polite, clear, with the amount and how to pay."
  h1="Gym fee reminder message templates"
  answer="A good gym fee reminder is short, private and specific: the member's name, the amount, the due date and how to pay, sent to the member alone, never to a group. Below are ready-to-send messages for before, on and after the due date, in English and Hindi."
  updated="2026-11-02"
  faq={faq}
  cta={{ label: 'See the dues list', href: `${base}for-gym-owners/`, text: 'SpotAI shows who owes, how many days late, and lets members pay with UPI in the app. Free pilot for Hyderabad gyms.' }}
>
  <h2>3 days before the due date</h2>
  <p class="msg">Hi {'{name}'}, a quick heads-up from {'{gym}'}: your membership renews on {'{date}'}. The amount is ₹{'{amount}'}. You can pay at the desk or by UPI to {'{upi id}'}. See you at the gym!</p>
  <p class="msg">नमस्ते {'{name}'}, {'{gym}'} की तरफ़ से याद दिलाना था: आपकी मेंबरशिप {'{date}'} को रिन्यू होनी है। राशि ₹{'{amount}'} है। डेस्क पर या UPI {'{upi id}'} पर भुगतान कर सकते हैं। जिम में मिलते हैं!</p>

  <h2>On the due date</h2>
  <p class="msg">Hi {'{name}'}, your {'{gym}'} membership is due today, ₹{'{amount}'}. Pay at the desk or UPI {'{upi id}'} and share the payment reference here. Thank you!</p>
  <p class="msg">नमस्ते {'{name}'}, आज आपकी {'{gym}'} मेंबरशिप की फ़ीस ₹{'{amount}'} देय है। डेस्क पर या UPI {'{upi id}'} पर भुगतान करें और रेफ़रेंस यहाँ भेज दें। धन्यवाद!</p>

  <h2>A few days after</h2>
  <p class="msg">Hi {'{name}'}, we noticed the {'{gym}'} fee of ₹{'{amount}'} from {'{date}'} is still open. If you have already paid, please send the reference and we will update it. If anything changed, just reply and we can sort it out.</p>
  <p class="msg">नमस्ते {'{name}'}, {'{date}'} की ₹{'{amount}'} फ़ीस अभी बाकी दिख रही है। अगर आपने भुगतान कर दिया है तो रेफ़रेंस भेज दें, हम अपडेट कर देंगे। कुछ बदला हो तो बताइए, मिलकर हल निकाल लेंगे।</p>

  <h2>For a member who stopped coming</h2>
  <p class="msg">Hi {'{name}'}, we haven't seen you at {'{gym}'} for a while. All good? Your membership ends on {'{date}'}. If timings are the problem, tell us; mornings before 7 are quiet this month.</p>

  <h2>Rules that keep reminders from annoying people</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>One member, one message.</strong> Never post dues in a group. It embarrasses people and shares their data.</li>
    <li><strong>Only if they agreed.</strong> Ask at joining whether they want reminders on WhatsApp, and stop if they say no.</li>
    <li><strong>Not at night.</strong> Keep reminders between morning and evening.</li>
    <li><strong>Say how to pay.</strong> A UPI ID or link in the message gets paid faster than "please clear your dues".</li>
    <li><strong>Notice who stopped coming.</strong> A member who hasn't visited in two weeks is about to not renew; talk to them before the due date.</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="note">Questions? Message us on WhatsApp at +{SITE.whatsapp.slice(0, 2)} {SITE.whatsapp.slice(2)}.</p>
</GuideLayout>
